From ca8df43b1def979614f68f0b7a0d127895e206f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qa-p1 <190369222+qa-p1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:48:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] UI: adopt the Arcade shared tokens and fix overflowing
 layouts

Base every colour on the Arcade neutrals and the Box accent, use the shared
radius and motion tokens, and replace the hard-coded greys and 7-10px fonts
in the older component styles. Sidebar navigation no longer overflows (its
grid tracks were sized to max-content), the catalog is a card grid, and
undefined variables in Clipboard history now resolve. Remove the placeholder
profile menu, the duplicate Categories button and the '0 planned' counter.
